# Keep the build context to source. Without this the context was ~860 MB
# (.next 382 MB + node_modules 478 MB) versus a few MB of actual source, and the
# host's node_modules was COPY'd over the clean `npm ci` layer — so a Linux image
# could end up carrying Windows-built native binaries (audit 2026-08-11).
# backend/ has had one of these since M10.1; frontend/ never got one.
node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
npm-debug.log*
